  "guide": "Optional, for users without an existing harness. Existing agents can continue using Rhyven apps without this runner. Install work-management 0.4.0, project-knowledge 0.4.0 and user-questions 0.1.0 in the same collection first. Configure RHYVEN_SECRET_MODEL_CONFIG as JSON with endpoint (full chat/completions URL), model, and optional api_key. Selected goal/context is sent to that endpoint; API costs are user-managed. start queues one bounded run; status includes a pending question ID; a human answers through User Questions then resume continues. Restart pauses unfinished runs; resume is explicit. Review model-written conclusions: this runner performs planning and knowledge work, not arbitrary code execution. No shell, marketplace, messaging-service or approval grants.",
